# Ethiopia Institutional Operating System (IOS) Example

## Overview

This example demonstrates how the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System (IOS) can be applied to Ethiopia's governance ecosystem.

It illustrates how governance, procurement, Digital Public Infrastructure (DPI), public finance, institutional coordination, institutional memory, and AI governance combine to transform public investment into long-term national capability.

This document is an illustrative institutional reference architecture.

---

# National Context

Country: Federal Democratic Republic of Ethiopia

Population: ~135 million

Government System: Federal Parliamentary Republic

Administrative Structure

- Federal Government
- Regional States
- City Administrations
- Zones
